    {
      "question": "Does this [On Play] effect set 1 of my DON!! cards as active before my [End of Your Turn] effects activate, or after?",
      "answer": "In this case, this [On Play] effect will set 1 of your DON!! cards as active after all of your [End of Your Turn] effects have activated and resolved.",
