    },
    {
      "question": "At the end of a turn in which I activated the [Activate: Main] effect of \"OP10-030 Smoker\", which states \"you cannot set DON!! cards as active using Character effects during this turn.\", can I use this [On Play] effect to set 1 of my DON!! cards as active?",
